          <section class="content-panel" id="developmentWorkspace">
            <h2>03 Â· Káº¿ hoáº¡ch &amp; Má»¥c tiÃªu (Nháº­t kÃ½ hÃ nh Ä‘á»™ng)</h2>

            <div class="controls-row" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
              <input type="text" id="goalTitle" class="input-compact" placeholder="Má»¥c tiÃªu / Nhiá»‡m vá»¥ (vÃ­ dá»¥: HoÃ n thÃ nh bÃ i táº­p Python)" />
              <input type="text" id="goalWhen" class="input-compact input-compact--fixed" placeholder="Thá»i gian (vÃ­ dá»¥: Tuáº§n 1â€“2)" />
            </div>

            <div class="controls-row" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
              <input type="text" id="goalNote" class="input-compact" placeholder="Ghi chÃº ngáº¯n (vÃ­ dá»¥: xem kÃªnh há»c, trang táº­p)" />
              <select id="goalCategory" class="input-compact input-compact--select">
                <option value="general">Chung</option>
                <option value="study">Há»c táº­p</option>
                <option value="project">Dá»± Ã¡n</option>
                <option value="skill">Ká»¹ nÄƒng</option>
              </select>
              <button class="primary-btn" id="addGoal">ThÃªm</button>
            </div>

            <div class="controls-row" style="margin-bottom:12px; gap:12px;">
              <button class="ghost-btn" id="savePlan">LÆ°u káº¿ hoáº¡ch</button>
              <button class="ghost-btn" id="exportPlan">Xuáº¥t káº¿ hoáº¡ch (PDF)</button>
              <button class="ghost-btn" id="clearPlan">XÃ³a toÃ n bá»™ (demo)</button>
            </div>

            <div id="goalsList" class="timeline" aria-live="polite">
              <!-- goals rendered here -->
            </div>

            <p class="muted">Ghi chÃº: tÃ­nh nÄƒng lÆ°u lÃ  demo dÃ¹ng localStorage. Äá»ƒ lÆ°u tháº­t cáº§n backend.</p>
          </section>
        </main>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="footer-container">
        <div class="footer-contact">
          <h4>LiÃªn há»‡</h4>
          <p>FuturePath â€” Há»— trá»£ Ä‘á»‹nh hÆ°á»›ng nghá» nghiá»‡p vÃ  phÃ¡t triá»ƒn ká»¹ nÄƒng cho há»c sinh.</p>
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@futurepath.vn">hello@futurepath.vn</a></p>
          <p><strong>Äiá»‡n thoáº¡i:</strong> <a href="tel:+840123456789">+84 0123 456 789</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-form">
          <h4>Nháº­n thÃ´ng tin &amp; tÆ° váº¥n</h4>
          <form id="contactForm" action="#" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Cáº£m Æ¡n! ChÃºng tÃ´i sáº½ liÃªn há»‡ sá»›m.');">
            <div class="field-row">
              <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email cá»§a báº¡n" required />
              <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Sá»‘ Ä‘iá»‡n thoáº¡i (tÃ¹y chá»n)" />
            </div>
            <div class="field-row">
              <button type="submit" class="primary-btn">Gá»­i</button>
              <button type="reset" class="ghost-btn">XÃ³a</button>
            </div>
